# Cursor Rules for TrueTrack Project

## Always Include in Context

-   Always include @.cursor/project-docs.md in the context for every prompt
-   This file contains the complete architecture overview, data flow, conventions, and guidelines for the TrueTrack project

## Project Guidelines

-   Don't create readme documentation unless explicitly asked
-   Don't auto-run the app after making changes
-   Do not refactor any code that is not necessary or explicitly requested
-   Never add inline styles. Always create classes and add the CSS to a .css file
-   Follow the conventions outlined in the project documentation
-   Update types in src/types/index.ts before changing persisted data shapes
-   Use CSS Modules for styling, avoid inline styles
-   Maintain the existing search index and persistence patterns
